{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Modern Settings Interface:** Brings iOS 18 and iOS 26 style aesthetics to earlier iOS versions.\n- **iOS 27 & Liquid Glass Style:** Supports liquid glass icons, sharper borders, light streaks, rounded corners, and Appearance page customization.\n- **Flexible Icon Options:** Choose between Default, Dark, Tinted, or Clear icon styles.\n- **Liquid Glass Slider:** Easily customize transparency and visual effects.\n- **Redesigned Apps Section:** Clean, organized grouped layouts for installed applications.\n- **Broad Compatibility:** Works on iOS 13 and later (Rootless).",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
